config VIDEO_S7D_GE2D
	tristate "Amlogic S7D 2D graphic acceleration unit"
	depends on ARCH_MESON_ODROID_COMMON && OF && COMMON_CLK && PM
	depends on V4L_MEM2MEM_DRIVERS && VIDEO_DEV
	depends on VIDEO_MESON_GE2D=n && AMLOGIC_MEDIA_ENABLE=n
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
	select V4L2_MEM2MEM_DEV
	help
	  V4L2 mem2mem driver for the S7D GE2D. It converts between the RGB
	  formats of the upstream driver and NV12, NV21, NV16, NV61 and
	  YUV24, also reads YUV420, YVU420, YUV422P and UYVY, scales up to
	  16x from the crop to the compose rectangle, flips and rotates, and
	  converts colour with the BT.601, BT.709 or BT.2020 matrix. A second,
	  multi-planar node offers the same and also reads two-buffer NV12M
	  and NV21M. Forked from the upstream Meson GE2D driver, which depends
	  on ARCH_MESON, with the S7D register block, direct address registers
	  and runtime power management.
